 LEVEL 0 FOR 10.0;
 LEVEL 1 FOR 10.0;
 LEVEL 0 FOR 10.0;
 LEVEL 1 FOR 10.0;
 LEVEL 0 FOR 10.0;
 LEVEL 1 FOR 10.0;
 LEVEL 0 FOR 10.0;
